  "description": "Teams only pick champions that can still take one of their open positions, and AI teams play them there - with nothing to set up. A champion's positions: League of Legends champions use their official main positions (all 173 built in, and the tft pack's Powder, Norra, Alune, Silco, Maddie, Loris, Kobuko, Vander, Violet, Krug, Ao Shin, Scar, Renni, Smeech, Sevika, Steb and Nomsy); other champions use the two main positions the game shows on their ban/pick card (where it has seen them played most) plus every position they have really played in your save. Two top-only champions are never picked together. Holds the AI's picks and your own (cards that do not fit are covered by a lock); once an AI team has picked, its champions are seated in positions they can play - where there is a choice, each with the player who plays it best (needs game 0.6.4 or later; older games only hold the picks). Bans are free, and when nothing on offer fits the draft just goes on. Press F7 anywhere for the settings panel: switches, and every champion's positions with one click (saved to settings.ini).\n\n双方只会选还能放进剩余空位的英雄，AI 队伍选完后每个英雄都会被安排到它能打的位置上，无需任何设置。英雄能打的位置：英雄联盟英雄用官方主位置（全部 173 个已内置）；其他英雄用选人卡片上游戏标注的两个主位置（游戏统计的最常用位置），加上你存档里它实际打过的位置。不会同时选两个只能打上路的英雄。AI 和你自己选人都受限制（放不下的英雄卡片会被锁住）；AI 队伍选完后由本 Mod 给它分路，有得选时把英雄交给最擅长它的选手（需要游戏 0.6.4 及以上，旧版本只限制选人）。禁用不受限制；没有合适的英雄时自动放开，不会卡住。任何界面按 F7 打开设置面板：开关和每个英雄的位置点一下就改好（自动保存到 settings.ini）。",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-29",
  "mod_id": "smart_position_lock",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "Smart Position Lock",
  "version": "1.3.41"
}
